---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout>
  <h2><code>.mcenahle.dev</code>网站生态</h2>

  <div class="article">
    <table class="usa-table">
      <thead>
        <tr style="background: #2b5bae; color: white;">
          <th>网站名</th>
          <th>GitHub 仓库</th>
          <th>详情</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>mcenahle.dev</td>
          <td
            ><a
              href="https://mcenahle.dev/gh/dev/"
              target="_blank"
              class="usa-link usa-link--external"
              ><Icon name="mdi:github" /> <u>访问</u></a
            ></td
          >
          <td>
            <a
              href="#example-modal-1"
              class="usa-button"
              aria-controls="example-modal-1"
              data-open-modal><u>详情</u></a
            >
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>game.mcenahle.dev</td>
          <td
            ><a
              href="https://mcenahle.dev/gh/game-dev-site/"
              target="_blank"
              class="usa-link usa-link--external"
              ><Icon name="mdi:github" /> <u>访问</u></a
            ></td
          >
          <td>
            <a
              href="#example-modal-2"
              class="usa-button"
              aria-controls="example-modal-2"
              data-open-modal><u>详情</u></a
            >
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>blog.mcenahle.dev</td>
          <td
            ><a
              href="https://mcenahle.dev/gh/mcenahle-blog-template/"
              class="usa-link usa-link--external"
              target="_blank"><Icon name="mdi:github" /> <u>访问</u></a
            ></td
          >
          <td>
            <a
              href="#example-modal-3"
              class="usa-button"
              aria-controls="example-modal-3"
              data-open-modal><u>详情</u></a
            >
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>
      2026年8月29日，开通<code>https://mcenahle.dev/gh/repo/path/</code
      >的短链接。访问
      <code>https://mcenahle.dev/gh/repo/path/</code>可被重定向到 <code
        >https://github.com/mcenahle/repo/path/</code
      >。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    class="usa-modal"
    id="example-modal-1"
    aria-labelledby="modal-1-heading"
    aria-describedby="modal-1-description"
  >
    <div class="usa-modal__content">
      <div class="usa-modal__main">
        <h2 class="usa-modal__heading" id="modal-1-heading">
          mcenahle.dev 开发
        </h2>
        <div class="usa-prose">
          <p id="modal-1-description" style="text-indent: 2em;">
            该网站的开发自从购买<code>mcenahle.dev</code
            >就已经开始，在购买之后及之后几日，基本使用 Astro
            完成了开发，后被逐渐废弃，随后于2026年8月29日中午及下午完成了降级改版。改版后访问速度大幅提升，重回经典风格。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="usa-modal__footer">
          <ul class="usa-button-group">
            <li class="usa-button-group__item">
              <a class="usa-button" href="/"> 返回首页 </a>
            </li>
            <li class="usa-button-group__item">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="usa-button usa-button--unstyled padding-105 text-center"
                data-close-modal
              >
                关闭
              </button>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="usa-button usa-modal__close"
        aria-label="Close this window"
        data-close-modal
      >
        <svg class="usa-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img">
          <use href="/assets/img/sprite.svg#close"></use>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="usa-modal"
    id="example-modal-2"
    aria-labelledby="modal-2-heading"
    aria-describedby="modal-2-description"
  >
    <div class="usa-modal__content">
      <div class="usa-modal__main">
        <h2 class="usa-modal__heading" id="modal-2-heading">
          game.mcenahle.dev 开发
        </h2>
        <div class="usa-prose">
          <p id="modal-2-description" style="text-indent: 2em;">
            在接触 DDLC 游戏，并被“第四面墙”、“<span style="user-select:none"
              >Sayo-nara</span
            >”吓到后，准备自己开发一个自己的 Ren'py
            游戏。目前该游戏项目被教资暂时搁置。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="usa-modal__footer">
          <ul class="usa-button-group">
            <li class="usa-button-group__item">
              <a
                class="usa-button"
                href="https://game.mcenahle.dev"
                target="_blank"
              >
                访问 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" />
              </a>
            </li>
            <li class="usa-button-group__item">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="usa-button usa-button--unstyled padding-105 text-center"
                data-close-modal
              >
                关闭
              </button>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="usa-button usa-modal__close"
        aria-label="Close this window"
        data-close-modal
      >
        <svg class="usa-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img">
          <use href="/assets/img/sprite.svg#close"></use>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="usa-modal"
    id="example-modal-3"
    aria-labelledby="modal-3-heading"
    aria-describedby="modal-3-description"
  >
    <div class="usa-modal__content">
      <div class="usa-modal__main">
        <h2 class="usa-modal__heading" id="modal-3-heading">
          blog.mcenahle.dev 开发
        </h2>
        <div class="usa-prose">
          <p id="modal-3-description" style="text-indent: 2em;">
            为了让个人博客网站具备个人性质，使用 Astro + Bootstrap 3
            搭建了一个个人博客 demo 网站。该网站目前已经陆续集成了众多使用功能。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="usa-modal__footer">
          <ul class="usa-button-group">
            <li class="usa-button-group__item">
              <a
                class="usa-button"
                href="https://blog.mcenahle.dev"
                target="_blank"
              >
                访问 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" />
              </a>
            </li>
            <li class="usa-button-group__item">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="usa-button usa-button--unstyled padding-105 text-center"
                data-close-modal
              >
                关闭
              </button>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="usa-button usa-modal__close"
        aria-label="Close this window"
        data-close-modal
      >
        <svg class="usa-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img">
          <use href="/assets/img/sprite.svg#close"></use>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
